{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>\u201cSomewhere on the margin of a page, a little stickman was drawn.\u201d</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pengame is a hand-crafted 2D shooter platformer, with a fully voice-acted story campaign set in a notebook. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/extras/d38bd449f89cd2f6e407cec6e7e15d98.poster.avif?t=1758205990\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/extras/d38bd449f89cd2f6e407cec6e7e15d98.webm?t=1758205990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/extras/d38bd449f89cd2f6e407cec6e7e15d98.mp4?t=1758205990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>\u201cThe number of foes was increasing. Good, he thought \u2013 it was a clear sign, he was getting closer to where he was meant to be.\u201d</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young student, bored during his classes, has created a vast world in his notebook. There was peace and harmony, until he made a horrible mistake: he sketched the most horrifying creature he could imagine on one of the sacred pages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through the notebook as <strong>Stickman</strong>, one of the numerous chosen ones destined to cleanse this hand-drawn world from the evil influence of <strong>The Teacher</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/extras/d8d47cc52ea06fcd8f2b3f9880493ddd.poster.avif?t=1758205990\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/extras/d8d47cc52ea06fcd8f2b3f9880493ddd.webm?t=1758205990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/extras/d8d47cc52ea06fcd8f2b3f9880493ddd.mp4?t=1758205990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>\u201cIt is fun to shoot things, we learned this about myself so far.\u201d</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat and exploration are the heart of Pengame. Stickman is a natural jumper, with some less-than-natural time manipulation abilities. He also has access to various weapons, with unique strengths and weaknesses. Mastering his arsenal and making use of his time manipulation talents are crucial to prevail against overwhelming odds and traverse through the most treacherous areas of the notebook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Double jumping</strong> &amp; <strong>wall jumps</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash teleportation</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 unique guns</strong>, each with an <strong>alternative firing</strong> mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various temporarily <strong>wieldable superweapons</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield the fabled Excalibur for a <strong>melee</strong> option.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time manipulation abilities (<strong>Bullet time</strong> &amp; <strong>Time reverse</strong>).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/extras/3bdcaf1d373376193272809430125899.poster.avif?t=1758205990\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/extras/3bdcaf1d373376193272809430125899.webm?t=1758205990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/extras/3bdcaf1d373376193272809430125899.mp4?t=1758205990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>\u201cThe old cowboy had his doubts about this new champion. He has seen so many fall, yet watching his world decay, he didn\u2019t have the luxury to be picky.\u201d</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What should you expect to find in Pengame?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-drawn graphics</strong> along with <strong>frame-by-frame animation</strong> (all done on paper).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original fully <strong>voice-acted</strong> <strong>story campaign</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over<strong> 40 unique enemy types </strong>and<strong> 7 bosses.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Linear story progression</strong> through hand-crafted levels, with <strong>optional exploration</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>gauntlet mode</strong> for those who want to keep going after beating the campaign. \u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/494240?t=1758205990","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/494240?t=1758205990","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/de541381d3e896489cb00c36c698da1568961aec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758205990","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494240/de541381d3e896489cb00c36c698da1568961aec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758205990","categories":[{"description"